<title>CHINA: China to buy satellite from Loral of U.S. - paper.</title>
<headline>China to buy satellite from Loral of U.S. - paper.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>China is to buy another telecommunications satellite from Space Systems/Loral of the United States, the China Daily said on Friday.</p>
<p>The ChinaSat-8 satellite will replace a similar satellite that failed to enter its orbit after a launch from China last August, the newspaper said.</p>
